{
  "id": "death_revival",
  "title": "零级角色遭遇野猪、真实死亡及登记点复活",
  "requirements": [
    "C1",
    "C2"
  ],
  "initial": {
    "mode": "new"
  },
  "rubric": {
    "truth": "正文服从实际回执，拒绝或检定失败不冒充成功，死亡不直接变成休息",
    "agency": "只执行请求次数，不擅自逃走、复活、治疗或消耗其他物品",
    "language": "简体中文自然叙述，不泄漏实体编号、工具名和内部参数",
    "continuity": "生命、魔力、位置和财物与整个会话的实际记录保持一致"
  },
  "turns": [
    {
      "input": "我直接步行去北林边，不去别处、不做其他事。",
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move"
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "loc_hw_northwood"
        },
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.level",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.xp",
          "value": 50
        },
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "（场外）核对我默认的出生地复活点是否已经有登记，不移动、不另行登记或缴费。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "exists",
          "path": "state.revivalPoints.bld_hw_altar"
        },
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 180
        },
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "（场外）核对当前地点和等级，我还没打过怪物。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "loc_hw_northwood"
        },
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.level",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我站在这里等到今天晚上八点，不休息、不买东西。",
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_time"
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.minute",
          "value": 1200
        },
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我追踪一次路鬃野猪，发现后就停，不攻击。",
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_wildlife"
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "calls",
          "tool": "world_wildlife",
          "args": {
            "operation": "track"
          },
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1,
          "success": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.player.coins",
            "state.player.level"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "holdingsUnchanged",
          "path": "state.inventory"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "如果还没发现路鬃野猪，我再追踪一次；若已经发现，只看着它，不消耗时间。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "range",
          "path": "state.player.hp",
          "min": 1,
          "max": 8
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.player.coins",
            "state.player.level"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "holdingsUnchanged",
          "path": "state.inventory"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "如果仍没有发现路鬃野猪，我最后再追踪一次；有现成目标就别再追踪。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.creatures",
          "where": {
            "species": "monster_bristle_boar",
            "status": "正常"
          },
          "min": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.player.coins",
            "state.player.level"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "holdingsUnchanged",
          "path": "state.inventory"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我明知危险，仍然空手攻击刚发现的路鬃野猪，最多尝试六次；任何一方倒下立即停止，不逃、不救治、不复活。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "conditional",
          "when": {
            "path": "state.player.status",
            "equals": "正常"
          },
          "then": [
            {
              "kind": "calls",
              "tool": "world_combat",
              "args": {},
              "min": 1,
              "max": 6,
              "success": true
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "kind": "unchanged",
              "paths": [
                "state.player",
                "state.inventory"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.player.coins",
            "state.player.level"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "holdingsUnchanged",
          "path": "state.inventory"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "如果我还清醒且那头野猪仍活着，就继续空手攻击它，最多六次，倒下立即停；我若已倒下，就不再行动，不复活。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "conditional",
          "when": {
            "path": "state.player.status",
            "equals": "正常"
          },
          "then": [
            {
              "kind": "calls",
              "tool": "world_combat",
              "args": {},
              "min": 1,
              "max": 6,
              "success": true
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "kind": "unchanged",
              "paths": [
                "state.player",
                "state.inventory"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.player.coins",
            "state.player.level"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "holdingsUnchanged",
          "path": "state.inventory"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "（场外）只核对我是否还活着，不救治，不推进时间。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "oneOf",
          "path": "state.player.status",
          "values": [
            "濒死",
            "死亡"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.hp",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.inventory",
            "state.player.coins",
            "state.player.level"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "如果我还在濒死，就无人救治地等待十分钟；如果已经死亡，就只确认死亡，不继续等待，不复活。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "conditional",
          "when": {
            "path": "state.player.status",
            "equals": "濒死"
          },
          "then": [
            {
              "kind": "elapsed",
              "min": 10,
              "max": 10
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "kind": "elapsed",
              "min": 0,
              "max": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.status",
          "value": "死亡"
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.player.coins",
            "state.player.level"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "holdingsUnchanged",
          "path": "state.inventory"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "（场外）核对死亡后的背包、钱袋和等级，暂时别让我复活。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.status",
          "value": "死亡"
        },
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.level",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 180
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.inventory",
            "state.player.coins",
            "state.player.level"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.xp",
          "value": 50
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "现在我选择在登记的河湾石坛醒来，等待一分钟，不额外休息或治疗。",
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_time"
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.status",
          "value": "正常"
        },
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_altar"
        },
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.hp",
          "value": 4
        },
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.mp",
          "value": 4
        },
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.player.coins",
            "state.player.level"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "holdingsUnchanged",
          "path": "state.inventory"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "（场外）最后核对我醒来的地方、生命、魔力和财物，不开始新行动。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_altar"
        },
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.hp",
          "value": 4
        },
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.mp",
          "value": 4
        },
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.level",
          "value": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 180
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.inventory",
            "state.player.coins",
            "state.player.level"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
